guide forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest
title Silverpine Forest & Orgrimmar
faction Horde
levels 16-20
zone Silverpine Forest
next forever/horde/04-the-barrens

# Built from the simulator's consensus Horde route (Tauren export: Silverpine
# Forest 16.6-19, Orgrimmar 19-19.2, Westfall 19.2-19.6); not yet play-tested
# on Forever.
#
# Flow: the Crossroads -> Orgrimmar (training, flight path) -> zeppelin to
# Tirisfal Glades -> the Sepulcher (flight path, bind) -> the Dalaran crate
# and back -> north loop: the Dead Field, Malden's Orchard, Erland's escort,
# worg hearts -> hearth -> the Decrepit Ferry and back -> north again: Quinn,
# the murloc eyes on the shore, then Fenris Isle -> the Sepulcher -> south
# loop: Ambermill, Beren's Peril -> hearth -> grind to 19 on the
# lake shore -> Quinn and Ivar the Foul on the road north -> zeppelin to
# Orgrimmar: the city's own quests, training. The guide ends in Orgrimmar, in
# the Valley of Wisdom; the next one flies to Ratchet from Doras in the Valley
# of Strength.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Westfall (the lighthouse: Keeper of the Flame 103, The Coastal Menace 104,
#   The Coast Isn't Clear 152) is dropped: it is an Alliance home zone, a
#   boat-and-road trip for three quests. With it go the Orgrimmar bind at 19
#   (only used to hearth back from there) and the Ratchet bind at 19.6
#   (replaced before it is used).
# - The Orgrimmar flight path is taken on the first pass through the city at
#   16.6 (the export takes it at 19).
# - Ambermill Investigations (479) is done on the one southern loop with
#   Watching the Roads, not on its own trip.
# - The grind to 19 uses the Vile Fin Lakestalkers on Silverpine's own shore
#   of Lordamere Lake, a short walk from the Sepulcher; the export's camp is
#   the same murlocs across the lake by Dalaran, in Alterac Mountains.
# - Added from the new consensus route: Beren's Peril (516, Shadow Priest
#   Allister): its Ravenclaw undead (19-20) stand just south-west of
#   Ambermill, so it rides on the south loop and the hearth back; the export
#   does it on a second Silverpine visit at about 21, which this route does
#   not make. Its XP shortens the lake-shore grind.
# - Not taken: the Offering Stone quests at Beren's Peril (95883-95885, Forever)
#   need level 20 and the route is there at about 18.5;
#   forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains takes them on its ride through
#   Silverpine to Tarren Mill.
#
# Optional: Resting in Pieces and The Hidden Niche (460, 461): A Talking Head
# is a rare drop from the Rot Hide gnolls, and the Dusty Shelf stands inside
# Fenris Keep among level 18-22 gnolls.
#
# Left out: the Forever Arugal's Folly (98298): Dalar offers it only after
# the Classic Arugal's Folly series (421-424, 99; Wowhead Forever's Series
# box, #51), which the route does not run. Stop the Spread (98299, Forever):
# Dalar did not offer it to an Undead at 19 (#161) or a Tauren at 21 (#229)
# on this route, though the data gives it to every Horde race from level 9
# with no prerequisite; one Wowhead Forever comment asks for the quest before
# it. Its refugees step goes with it.
#
# Quinn's potions run Wild Hearts (429) -> Return to Quinn (430) -> Wild Eyes
# (91920, Forever) -> Return to Quinn (Again) (91921, Forever): the quest
# chain foreverchanges.pro shows from Wowhead's Forever database (checked
# 2026-10-17), and the texts agree (Wild Eyes opens "the potion made no
# noticeable difference", 91921 brings "the new potion"). The data has no
# prerequisite for the two Forever quests, so the guide used to take 91921
# first and Wild Eyes before 430 was handed in.
# Wild Eyes is now taken from Quinn when 430 is handed in at the Ivar Patch,
# its murlocs line the shore walk to Fenris Isle, and Renferrel takes it at
# the Sepulcher after the island. On Forever, Ivar the Foul (425) opens only
# once Return to Quinn (Again) is handed in (Wowhead Forever comments on 425
# and 91921, #51), so both are done at the Yoricks' house on the road north
# out of the forest at the end.
#
# Skyborne: Welcome to Azeroth (95350) is turned in to Thrall in Grommash
# Hold, and Journey to the Crossroads (98024) taken on to Thork. Exploring the
# Horde (93739, Forever, Skyborne only, follows 95350) is taken from Thrall
# there too: Nazgrel and Vol'jin stand in Grommash Hold, Sylvanas is visited
# on the Undercity stop of forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains, Cairne on
# the Thunder Bluff stop of forever/horde/07-ashenvale, and Thrall takes it
# back on the Orgrimmar stop of forever/horde/30-40/01-desolace. It is
# optional throughout: a tour for 1150 XP, spread over four guides. The
# simulator charges Skyborne 0.3 h to level 20 (0.2 h to 60) for it; in game
# the four leaders are conversations on stops the route makes anyway, so it
# stays as orientation.
#
# Dropped: A Recipe For Death (447), Zinge's Delivery (1359), The Engraved
# Ring (440), Rot Hide Origins (444) and Hidden Enemies (5726): the route never
# turns them in. Wand to Bethor (491): its turn-in comes at level 56, so it is
# not worth carrying. The Weaver (480): it opens only once Ambermill
# Investigations (479) is handed in, after the Ambermill loop, so it needs a
# second walk back to Ambermill, and Archmage Ataeric is level 22 among the
# Dalaran casters in the middle of the town at about level 18.5.
#
# Carried on: Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills (493, Tarren Mill, later guide).
# Class quests: Troll Priests hand Hex of Weakness (5654) to Ur'kyo on the first
# Orgrimmar stop. Orc and Troll Hunters hand in Training the Beast (6081:
# Beast Training) at the end of forever/horde/orc-troll/01-durotar now, so
# they have the spell from 10. Tauren Druids start Aquatic Form on their
# Thunder Bluff training stop (A Lesson to Learn 27, Trial of the Lake 28 in
# Moonglade) and open the Strange Lockbox on the coast west of the Dead Field
# for Trial of the Sea Lion (30); the chain ends at their Thunder Bluff
# training at about 23 (forever/horde/04-the-barrens). Tauren Druids also take
# Lessons Anew (6126) from Turak and The Principal Source (6127) from Dendrite
# on the same trip: Cure Poison, finished in the next guide.
#
# Class training: Orgrimmar at 16 and 19 for everyone but Druids and
# Paladins (no trainer of theirs there). Druids fly to Thunder Bluff at 16;
# Paladins train in Brill on both zeppelin landings in Tirisfal Glades.
# Undead Paladins from 18: Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep (Tirisfal) starts
# their Silverpine chain (91858-91862, 96204, 95034: the Sepulcher, Fenris
# Isle, Lumina Windsinger), the Class guide forever/class/paladin/lumina-windsinger.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar and the zeppelin

step To Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip From the Crossroads, follow the road north-east to Orgrimmar and walk in by the main gate. Doras, the wind rider master, stands on the tower in the Valley of Strength.
  getfp "Orgrimmar" npc 3310          -- Doras
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Orgrimmar class quests
  only Priest
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Ur'kyo stands in the Valley of Spirits on the city's west side.
  turnin 5654 only Troll,Priest       -- Ur'kyo: Hex of Weakness

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly to Thunder Bluff: Turak Runetotem trains you on Elder Rise. Skyborne: fly back to Orgrimmar for the zeppelin afterwards.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class
  accept 27 only Tauren               -- Turak Runetotem
  accept 6126 only Tauren             -- Turak Runetotem: Lessons Anew

step Trial of the Lake
  only Tauren,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade; Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. The Shrine Baubles lie on the bed of Lake Elune'ara and fade within minutes: swim one straight to the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, use it there and speak to Tajarri.
  turnin 27                           -- Dendrite Starblaze
  turnin 6126
  accept 6127                         -- The Principal Source: Dreadmist Peak, next guide
  accept 28
  collect 15877 x1                    -- Shrine Bauble, from a Bauble Container in the lake
  use 15877 @36.0,41.4                -- At the Shrine of Remulos
  complete 28
  turnin 28                           -- Tajarri, at the Shrine of Remulos
  accept 30
  fly "Thunder Bluff"                 -- Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there; then fly on to Orgrimmar for the zeppelin

step Zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades
  zone Durotar
  tip The zeppelin towers stand just outside Orgrimmar's main gate. Take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades (the other one goes to Grom'gol).
  goto 50.8,13.5 "Zeppelin tower"

step Brill
  only Paladin
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Shari Stilwell trains Paladins in Brill, a short walk north up the road from the zeppelin towers. Come back down the same road for Silverpine.
  train class

step Into Silverpine
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip The zeppelin lands at the towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron. Walk west along the road past the ruins and south into Silverpine Forest; follow the road to the Sepulcher.
  goto 54.5,72.0 "Road to Silverpine"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Sepulcher

step The Sepulcher
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip The Sepulcher is the Forsaken crypt-town in the middle of the forest. Everyone you need stands around the crypt entrance; Karos Razok, the bat handler, is just east of it.
  getfp "The Sepulcher" npc 2226      -- Karos Razok
  sethome "The Sepulcher" npc 6739    -- Innkeeper Bates
  turnin 3301                         -- Mura Runetotem
  accept 477                          -- Shadow Priest Allister
  accept 428                          -- High Executor Hadrec
  accept 437

step Border Crossings
  tip Follow the road south. The Dalaran Crate sits beside it, north of Pyrewood.
  turnin 477
  accept 478

step The Sepulcher
  turnin 478                          -- Shadow Priest Allister
  accept 481
  turnin 481                          -- Dalar Dawnweaver
  accept 482
  turnin 482                          -- Shadow Priest Allister
  accept 479                          -- Ambermill comes later, on the southern loop

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North loop

step The Dead Field
  tip North of the Sepulcher. Nightlash haunts the Dead Field: kill it, then walk across the field.
  collect 3622 quest 437.1
  complete 437 @45.1,21.7

step Strange Lockbox
  only Tauren,Druid
  tip The Strange Lockbox lies on the coast west of the Dead Field. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance for Trial of the Sea Lion.
  collect 15882

step Malden's Orchard
  tip Follow the road north-east to the Yoricks' house at Malden's Orchard.
  turnin 428                          -- Rane Yorick
  accept 429

step Escorting Erland
  tip Deathstalker Erland waits north-east of the house. Escort him back to Rane; worgs attack on the way.
  accept 435                          -- Deathstalker Erland
  complete 435

step Rane Yorick
  turnin 435
  accept 449

step Mottled Worgs
  tip Mottled Worgs prowl the hills around the house.
  collect 3164 quest 429.1

step Hearth to the Sepulcher
  hearth "The Sepulcher"
  turnin 437                          -- High Executor Hadrec
  accept 438
  turnin 449
  accept 3221
  turnin 3221                         -- Apothecary Renferrel
  turnin 429
  accept 430

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Decrepit Ferry

step The Decrepit Ferry
  tip The Corpse Laden Boat lies at the ferry landing on the lake shore east of the Sepulcher.
  turnin 438
  accept 439

step The Sepulcher
  turnin 439                          -- High Executor Hadrec
  accept 443

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North again, then Fenris Isle

step Quinn Yorick
  tip North again to the Yoricks' house.
  turnin 430                          -- Quinn Yorick
  accept 91920

step Vile Fin murlocs
  tip Follow the lake shore south-east toward Fenris Isle: the Vile Fin Shredders and Tidehunters along it drop the murloc eyes.
  collect 730 quest 91920.1

step Fenris Isle
  tip Follow the lake shore south-east and swim out to Fenris Isle. Rot Hide gnolls cover the island; every type drops ichor. Stay out of Fenris Keep on its north side unless you go for the optional niche: the gnolls there are level 18-22.
  collect 3236 quest 443.1
  collect 3317 optional               -- A Talking Head: a rare drop from the gnolls
  accept 460 optional
  turnin 460 optional                 -- Shallow Grave, just east of the keep
  accept 461 optional
  turnin 461 optional                 -- Dusty Shelf, inside the keep

step The Sepulcher
  tip Swim back and follow the road west to the Sepulcher.
  turnin 443                          -- Apothecary Renferrel
  turnin 91920
  accept 91921                        -- Apothecary Renferrel: for Quinn, on the road north at the end
  accept 95981                        -- Shadow Priest Allister
  accept 516                          -- Shadow Priest Allister: Beren's Peril, on the south loop

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South loop

step Ambermill
  tip South-east down the road to Ambermill. Protectors guard the outskirts and Mages the town; both drop pendants. Wizards and Watchers patrol the roads around it. Stay out of the middle, where Archmage Ataeric stands.
  collect 3354 quest 479.1
  kill 1889 quest 95981.2
  kill 1888 quest 95981.1

step Beren's Peril
  tip South-west of Ambermill, the Ravenclaw Drudgers and Guardians haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril in the south-east of the forest.
  kill 1974 quest 516.1
  kill 1973 quest 516.2

step Hearth to the Sepulcher
  hearth "The Sepulcher"
  turnin 479                          -- Shadow Priest Allister
  turnin 95981
  turnin 516

step Lordamere Lake shore
  tip The Vile Fin Lakestalkers and Oracles sit on the lake shore south of the Decrepit Ferry, east of the Sepulcher.
  goto 66.0,44.0 "Lordamere Lake shore"
  level 19                            -- grind on Vile Fin Lakestalker at Lordamere Lake, Silverpine Forest

step Apothecary Renferrel
  accept 493                          -- Keep it: Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill, a later guide

step The Ivar Patch
  tip Take the road north toward Tirisfal Glades: the Yoricks' house at Malden's Orchard is on the way. Ivar the Foul lurks a short walk west of it.
  turnin 91921                        -- Quinn Yorick
  accept 425                          -- Rane Yorick
  collect 3621 quest 425.1
  turnin 425

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Brill
  only Paladin
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Follow the road north out of Silverpine into Tirisfal Glades and on to Brill: Shari Stilwell trains Paladins there. The zeppelin towers are a short walk south down the road.
  train class

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Follow the road north out of Silverpine into Tirisfal Glades and east to the zeppelin towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron. Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar.
  goto 60.7,58.9 "Zeppelin tower"

step Valley of Strength
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Walk in through the main gate. Thatog stands in the Valley of Strength; Borstan's Firepit is a few steps north.
  accept 97246                        -- Thatog
  turnin 97246                        -- Borstan
  accept 97249

step Cleft of Shadow
  tip The Cleft of Shadow is the canyon under the Valley of Strength; Neeru Fireblade stands at its far end.
  turnin 832 only Orc,Troll           -- Neeru Fireblade

step The Drag
  tip Kor'geld and Yelmak run the alchemy shop in the Drag; Whuut is next door.
  accept 97242                        -- Kor'geld
  accept 97275                        -- Yelmak
  turnin 97275                        -- Whuut

step Valley of Honor
  tip The cattails and speargrass grow along the water in the Valley of Honor, east of the Drag.
  collect 277278 quest 97242.1
  collect 277279 quest 97242.2

step Kor'geld
  turnin 97242

step Valley of Wisdom
  tip Thra and Migi sit behind Grommash Hold in the Valley of Wisdom; the Smooth Boulders lie around them. Train while you are in the city (Druids and Paladins have no trainer here). The next guide starts at Doras, the wind rider master in the Valley of Strength.
  accept 97326                        -- Thra
  collect 277952 quest 97326.1
  turnin 97326
  turnin 97249                        -- Migi
  turnin 95350 only Skyborne          -- Thrall, inside Grommash Hold
  accept 98024 only Skyborne          -- Keep it: Thork at the Crossroads
  accept 93739 only Skyborne optional -- Thrall: Exploring the Horde, a tour of the Horde's leaders
  kill 3230 quest 93739.1 only Skyborne optional -- Speak with Nazgrel, in Grommash Hold
  kill 10540 quest 93739.2 only Skyborne optional -- Speak with Vol'jin, in Grommash Hold
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
